From c323252ea6d102077ec1b48d357fb5870c9846fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (via Saurav)" <saurav@fois-project.local>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 11:45:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Auto-fill PAN number via client-side OCR on PAN card upload

- Add tesseract.js + pdfjs-dist for OCR of uploaded PAN PDFs
- New utils/panOcr.js: renders PDF page to canvas, runs OCR, regex-matches PAN format
- CustomerRegistration.jsx: on PAN file select, scan and auto-fill the PAN No. field
- Shows scanning/success/not-found status under the PAN field
